<title>POLAND: EXBUD SEPT GROUP NET JUMPS TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>EXBUD SEPT GROUP NET JUMPS TO PLN 1.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Group net profit	     1.46 vs   0.88</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	 2.34 vs   1.40</p>
<p> Group operating profit     1.10 vs   1.54</p>
<p> Group sales		   65.37 vs  43.85</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Group net profit	    10.37 vs   9.22</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit	15.28 vs  13.14</p>
<p> Group operating profit    15.41 vs  12.64</p>
<p> Group sales		  422.21 vs 303.86</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.52 vs   0.51</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.67 vs   0.71</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.00 vs   0.62</p>
<p> Sales		   40.91 vs  20.71</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.55 vs   9.32</p>
